Census reference data
----------------------
Files: extdata/v2/tiger_addr_feat_catalog/2024/county_zip.parquet,
       extdata/v2/tiger_addr_feat_catalog/2025/county_zip.parquet;
       the county and place-to-ZCTA reference tables in R/sysdata.rda.
Provider: U.S. Census Bureau.
Sources: TIGER/Line address features (2024 and 2025), 2020 ZCTA-to-place and
         ZCTA-to-county-subdivision relationship files, and the 2025 county
         adjacency reference. inst/make_reference_data.R records the source
         URLs and transformations for the county and place reference tables.
Terms: Census Bureau data are in the public domain; credit the Census Bureau
       as the source. Products derived from these data are not Census Bureau
       products or endorsements.
       https://www.census.gov/about/policies/citation.html
Preparation: The addr authors constructed ZIP/county range-count catalogs
             and normalized county/place lookup tables from these sources.
